    {
      "id": 101,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "homeaway-vm"
      },
      "targets": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### TEMPERATURE PEAKS · SELECTED TIME RANGE\nLarge values are the maximum **recorded** temperature over the chosen Grafana time window. Each background sparkline follows **only the specific sensor that hit that peak**, not the hottest sensor at each moment. Sensor labels use SensorDash aliases when present (otherwise the hardware name)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "CPU · peak (selected range)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "homeaway-vm"
      },
      "description": "Peak CPU temperature from observed samples in the selected Grafana range. The sparkline traces only the single physical sensor responsible for the selected period's peak (picked once at the end of the range), using interval maxima to retain brief spikes; the displayed maximum comes from that sensor's history, not its latest reading. The small label prefers the SensorDash alias and otherwise uses the original sensor name, with underscores normalized only in display. Missing samples remain missing. A sensor identity can change if you select another time range.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "homeaway-vm"
          },
          "expr": "label_transform(label_transform(((max_over_time(sensordash_reading_value{host=~\"$host\",kind=\"Temperature\"}[$__interval]) and on(host,sensor) (topk(1, max_over_time(sensordash_reading_value{host=~\"$host\",kind=\"Temperature\"}[$__range] @ end()) * on(host,sensor) group_left() (last_over_time(sensordash_sensor_info_value{host=~\"$host\",device_type=\"Cpu\",kind=\"Temperature\",name!~\"(?i).*(warning|critical).*\"}[$__range] @ end()) == 1)))) * on(host,sensor) group_left(name) ((label_replace(last_over_time(sensordash_sensor_info_value{host=~\"$host\",device_type=\"Cpu\",kind=\"Temperature\",name!~\"(?i).*(warning|critical).*\",alias!=\"unassigned\"}[$__range] @ end()) == 1, \"name\", \"$1\", \"alias\", \"(.+)\") or (last_over_time(sensordash_sensor_info_value{host=~\"$host\",device_type=\"Cpu\",kind=\"Temperature\",name!~\"(?i).*(warning|critical).*\",alias=\"unassigned\"}[$__range] @ end()) == 1)))), \"name\", \"_+\", \" \"), \"name\", \"^ +| +$\", \"\")",
          "legendFormat": "{{name}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "celsius",
          "noValue": "—",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#f2bd6d"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "textSize": {
              "titleSize": 13,
              "valueSize": 46
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "max"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "vertical",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "wideLayout": false,
        "justifyMode": "center"
      }
    },
